<title>CANADA: CWB details primary elevator space on Prairies.</title>
<headline>CWB details primary elevator space on Prairies.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vacant space in primary elevators across the Prairies held steady in the past week, Canadian Wheat Board said.</p>
<p>Twenty-seven percent of space remained available in primary elevators across the Prairies for the second consecutive week.</p>
<p>Alberta elevators had 31 percent of space available compared to 37 percent the week before.</p>
<p>Sasaktchewan elevators had 26 percent of space available compared to 24 percent the week before.</p>
<p>Manitoba elevators had 22 percent of space available.</p>
<p>That compared to 20 percent the week before, CWB said.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204-947-3548))</p>
